# ── Slide sources (2026-08-19) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# The hand-edited .pptx decks are the source of truth. The .md render sources
# have diverged from them, so a re-render from .md would silently clobber the
# PowerPoint edits. Kept LOCALLY (still on disk, diff_deck_vs_source.py still
# works) but removed from the repo so nobody renders from a stale source.
# Last tracked state is preserved in git history at commit 2b277e2.
blackhat-2026-adversarial-ai/*/slides/*.md

# Exceptions — decks with no rendered .pptx yet, so there is no source of truth
# to defer to. Remove these lines once each has been rendered and hand-checked.
!blackhat-2026-adversarial-ai/M9-training-data-extraction/slides/m9.md

# Backups written by _templates/fix_code_blocks.py
*.pptx.bak
